    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About VE CALAIS</string>
    <string name="about_description">VE CALAIS OBD2 Reader v2.1.0 - DTC Codes, Page Reorder + Holden/HSV Theme\n\nA specialized OBD2 live data reader for 2011 Holden VE Calais Redline L77 with Killaboost G42-1450 turbo kit.\n\nVehicle locked to E38 ECU verification.\n\n✓ 46 verified PIDs from your actual car scan\n✓ 3-bar MAP sensor scaling (0-300 kPa)\n✓ Complete TCM data (6L80E, T43 controller)\n✓ E85/98 flex fuel monitoring\n✓ Real-time boost, line pressure, TCC slip\n\nOwner: Nathan Brookes (FOX95S)\nVehicle: 2011 Holden VE Calais Redline\nEngine: L77 6.0L V8 (DOD Deleted)\nTransmission: 6L80E Auto\nTurbo: Killaboost G42-1450 with 3-bar MAP\n\nDyno: 340 rwkW</string>
